comments.body:
@allenbaron thanks a ton for the report.

@sabrinatoro I would like to obsolete the equivalence.obo file at least, and ideally also the equivalence.owl file. There is NO point using these nowadays over the mondo.sssom.tsv file. Here is how I want to deal with this:

1. officially obsolete equivalence release artefacts (equivalencies.json, equivalencies.owl, equivalencies.obo)
2. introduce sssom outputs (mondo.sssom.tsv, mondo.sssom.json, mondo.sssom.owl - no OBO)

This change should be announced in the next Mondo release email.
